OL,3,AOfficials giving update after four
OL,4,Akilled and dozens injured in Canadian
OL,5,Amilitary base fire
OL,6,
OL,7,FA defence spokesperson says that, while
OL,8,Finvestigations are under way, "at this
OL,9,Ftime, there are no indications that it
OL,10,Fwas the result of any terrorist
OL,11,Factivity"
OL,13,FCanadian Forces Base Wainwright, where
OL,14,Fthe fire broke out about 16:00 local
OL,15,Ftime (22:00 GMT) on Saturday, is one of
OL,16,Fthe country's busiest military training
OL,17,Fbases
